    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">The knowledge of your people, lost and scattered as it may be is a treasure of its own, and you have access to what you have managed to gather. You become trained in Occultism and Medicine.</span> <span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">For each of these skills in which you were already trained, you become trained in a skill of your choice. You also become gain the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.BocFD2KV0qgUC76x]{Additional Lore} feat for Aelkhazak Lore.</span></p>"
